{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/411078-what-are-children-of-angels-like","id":411078,"title":"What are Children of Angels like ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-18T22:35:59-08:00","id":411078,"title":"What are Children of Angels like ?","content":"I have been thinking about this for a bit. Being Angels take human covers when they are in the world also not always but some do what happens if an angel gets pregnant what would the child be like ?<br /> <br /> I think it would be interesting if that happen as apart of a god machine plan.What kind of powers would that child have being the child of an angel. I think maybe an exiles might do this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T22:52:32-08:00","id":411109,"title":"","content":"I think one of the implications of <i>Heirs to Hell</i> was that the God-Machine needs the Demon-Blooded, because it can't make them itself (see; the Demon-Blooded Cipher). That said, could I see Infrastructure attempts to create stigmatic children, or to maybe have a Messenger deliver a divine birth? Totally.<br /> <br /> Look forward to <i>Giants in the Earth</i> in the upcoming Storyteller's Guide; given that the title refers to the nephilim, who are sometimes interpreted as being the children of Biblical angels, I think your question might be answered there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T23:03:27-08:00","id":411118,"title":"","content":"Thing is, with the Nephilim legend, it's specifically an act of Disobedience for an Angel to lay with human and conceive a Nephil, so applying that legend to the God-Machine Angels, they'd be the Unchained and their offspring we already know about.<br /> <br /> Of course the Giants in the Earth setting I believe is an alternate cosmology so THERE the results may be very different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T23:54:42-08:00","id":411141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/411078-what-are-children-of-angels-like?p=411118#post411118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thing is, with the Nephilim legend, it's specifically an act of Disobedience for an Angel to lay with human and conceive a Nephil, so applying that legend to the God-Machine Angels, they'd be the Unchained and their offspring we already know about.<br /> <br /> Of course the Giants in the Earth setting I believe is an alternate cosmology so THERE the results may be very different.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/6501522/how-to-kill-a-child-process-by-the-parent-process\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/6501522/how-to-kill-a-child-process-by-the-parent-process\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/6501522/how-to-kill-a-child-process-by-the-parent-process\" target=\"_blank\"> https://stackoverflow.com/questions/6501522/how-to-kill-a-child-process-by-the-parent-process </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Horrifying once you think about it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T00:51:51-08:00","id":411180,"title":"","content":"I don't think angels can get pregnant or father a child. They are ephemeral beings which manifest in human form, which is quite different from a demon becoming human if in cover. This could be the reason the god machine looks for demonic offspring instead of just sending an angel to spread the love...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1125-gflash","name":"gflash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1125_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T04:22:48-08:00","id":411304,"title":"","content":"Part of the dichotomy between an angel and demon is that angels are &quot;pure&quot; spirits, in a way. Biology is messy, the body gets hungry, thirsty, tired. Angels are none of those. I doubt that angels would ever have a period. Its too messy, complicated. Tangle of emotions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T05:30:53-08:00","id":411329,"title":"","content":"There's a bit in one of the books where a Demon talks about their last mission being a deep-cover thing which involved them siring a kid. That was <i>before</i> they fell. So it seems that Angels are capable of producing children, but it might be that with a full infrastructure keeping their identity in place you don't get the glitch that makes them <i>Offspring. </i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T05:34:43-08:00","id":411330,"title":"","content":"Being that's true would that mean they use demon powers. Hmmm it would be interesting to see demon children fighting children of angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T04:13:55-08:00","id":412624,"title":"","content":"I very much like the concept of the GM creating a birthing infrastructure for angel offspring/fractals, though that would be very hard to do without encouraging a Fall unless the required angels were essentially Axlotl Tanks from Dune. All those weird emotions that come with having a child and going through labor is something that the Angel would have to deal with, and would be at the very least an interesting origin story for a demon.<br /> <br /> Though that does bring up a good concept for the demon-blooded game I have been working on: Angel Axlotl Tank + Captured Demon/Stigmatic = Fractal/Offspring generator - offspring/fractals kept at a training facility/private school somewhere in Bellvue or Mercer Island, Seattle. Maybe even Renton. Used to hunt demons, like escaped captives that claim they are the offspring/fractals parents....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5032-jackofshadows","name":"Jackofshadows","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T06:24:07-08:00","id":412678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jackofshadows</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/411078-what-are-children-of-angels-like?p=412624#post412624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I very much like the concept of the GM creating a birthing infrastructure for angel offspring/fractals, though that would be very hard to do without encouraging a Fall unless the required angels were essentially Axlotl Tanks from Dune. All those weird emotions that come with having a child and going through labor is something that the Angel would have to deal with, and would be at the very least an interesting origin story for a demon.<br /> <br /> Though that does bring up a good concept for the demon-blooded game I have been working on: Angel Axlotl Tank + Captured Demon/Stigmatic = Fractal/Offspring generator - offspring/fractals kept at a training facility/private school somewhere in Bellvue or Mercer Island, Seattle. Maybe even Renton. Used to hunt demons, like escaped captives that claim they are the offspring/fractals parents....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> hmmmm OOOOO the infrastructure could be a sperm bank were to do artificial insemination.<br /> <br /> hmmm that would be interesting god machine has angels have children. Then have those children hunting down demons or there offspring. hmmm what would happen if a demon offspring had a child with a angel offspring. hmmmm","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 02-20-2015, 09:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T06:33:39-08:00","id":412682,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure the powers would actually be any different. Angels are mentioned to use embeds. It just comes so naturally to them they don't really think about it. So it makes sense that their Offspring would use them too, just like the demonic sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T06:43:38-08:00","id":412686,"title":"","content":"No angels use Numia","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T07:07:51-08:00","id":412708,"title":"","content":"Those are their &quot;powers&quot;. They also use embed-like abilities more or less unconsciously. It's just how they understand the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T09:46:22-08:00","id":412897,"title":"","content":"hmmm maybe children of angels can use numia","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T16:49:47-08:00","id":413379,"title":"","content":"When it comes to angels, Numina are mechanics, not narrative. Their numina abilities are representative of their ability to change and alter reality in a way similar to a Demon, but with perfect efficiency. This is why they are Numina because Numina are generally more powerful and designed solely for use by an NPC.<br /> <br /> Angelic Off-Spring would, in my opinion, be the same as the likewise Demonic pairing. Offspring aren't &quot;demon spawn&quot;, they're &quot;Offspring&quot;. This always made a core implication to me that they <b>are</b> the nephilim. If you wanted, however, to mechanically represent the difference between a Demonic child and an Angelic child then perhaps you could simply make them <i>all </i>Fractals regardless of the pairing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T01:45:52-08:00","id":413917,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I see them as Offspring or Fractals. Essentially angel+human/stigmatic = offspring, possibly latent if human is not stigmatic. Angel+angel/demon = Fractal. I would just use the rules out of Heirs to Hell. Also important in regards to their particular Cipher and how it interacts with demons and the world around them...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5032-jackofshadows","name":"Jackofshadows","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}